    "enUS": {
      "description": "Here, take this amulet to Gor'mul, and see if the raptors' strength can awaken the flame of the warrior that once burned through his veins.",
      "dialogue": {
        "72548d385d74da42b217": "Here, take this amulet to Gor'mul, and see if the raptors' strength can awaken the flame of the warrior that once burned through his veins.",
        "9d74c0c54272bcaf3860": "What hope is there when the hand of a coward can slay the mightiest of the mightiest? What hope, I ask you!",
        "e3aac1acfd2d19be8f64": "What is this? Polished bone. What use have I for polished bone? Will a trinket restore the Horde to its glory?"
      },
      "summary": "Give the Raptor Talon Amulet to Gor'mul.",
      "title": "Raising Spirits",
